      "explorer": "The Quran is the holy book of Islam, revealed to Prophet Muhammad ﷺ through the angel Jibril. Reading the Quran is one of the most rewarding acts a Muslim can do — each letter earns 10 rewards. Muslims try to read the Quran daily, especially during Ramadan. The Quran is in Arabic, but translations help us understand its meanings. Reading with understanding and reflection is the goal.",
