      "explorer": "The Day of Judgment (Yawm al-Qiyamah) is when all people will be resurrected and brought before Allah to be judged for their deeds. Every action — even the smallest kindness — will be weighed on a scale. Those whose good deeds outweigh their bad will enter Paradise (Jannah), a place of eternal happiness. Those whose bad deeds are heavier will face punishment. This belief motivates Muslims to always do their best.",
